not did I come across any other item which would make the drawbridge fall.

So I quit... 

I encountered only two measly shops on the way down.

I've heard of people making it to the castle level with tons of good stuff...

SO HOW DO YOU GET IT? 

I came across only on amulet, and it was cursed strangling.

It seems like altars to thoth are less frequent than those to the other gods.

I got baby dragons, and let them grow up, but they NEVER used their
breath weapon.

And when I polymorphed into a dragon I could do nothing except belch...
(why? how can you fix this problem?)

It seems rather discouraging that nethack lets you die so many ways, without
letting you put up a fight... i.e. walking in on medusa, when you don't know 
it's the medusa level... or hiting that blob that puts you to sleep for 
hundreds of turns ... 

what do you do if you play a game which simply doesns't give you much stuff
on the way down... just quit after a few hours?

